# Components

## Map

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| Navbar | Header + menu trigger |
| CurveMenu/Menu, Curve | Fullscreen nav, SVG curve animation |
| Hero, MissionSection, MessageSection, EventsSection | Homepage sections |
| Footer, FooterContent | Sticky footer reveal (desktop clip-path) |
| SmoothScroll | Lenis wrapper — wraps children in `page.tsx` |

## Rules

- Add `'use client'` only when needed (hooks, events, motion, Lenis)
- Use theme tokens from `globals.css` (`primary`, `secondary`, `accent`, etc.)
- Framer: variants pattern like `CurveMenu/Menu.tsx`; menu easing `[0.76, 0, 0.24, 1]`
- Keep section components focused; avoid pulling CMS/API logic into sections until `lib/` exists

## Animation

- Shared keyframes in `app/globals.css`: `slideUp`, `fadeIn`
